# Set / search the robot pose on the prior map.
#   mode "pose": base_link pose (x, y, yaw) in map, e.g. from RViz / web
#   mode "auto": global search seeded on the mapping trajectory (no prior)
#   mode "last": pose saved at the last shutdown (maps/<name>/last_pose.yaml)
string mode
float64 x
float64 y
float64 yaw
---
bool success
string message
float64 x
float64 y
float64 yaw
float64 score          # auto: fraction of scan points matching the map
